{
  "id": "406",
  "title": "Should I Wear a Tie?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-11-22",
  "synopsis": "He Jing is getting ready for an opening ceremony he's visiting together with Manager Wang.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/582/ceb3233a81d08253fb215eef06e56b46ae88e9e5.mp3?1698352168",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我要打领带吗？\n\n丽丽：你明天要去参加开业典礼，是吗？\n何京：是的。\n丽丽：和你们王总？\n何京：是的。你说我要打领带吗？\n丽丽：嗯……还是打领带吧！比较正式一些。\n何京：我的西服呢？\n丽丽：哎呀，我帮你拿去洗衣店洗，忘记取回来了。\n何京：现在洗衣店还开门吗？\n丽丽：那么晚了，应该关门了。\n何京：没关系，那我明天去取。",
    "traditional": "我要打領帶嗎？\n\n麗麗：你明天要去參加開業典禮，是嗎？\n何京：是的。\n麗麗：和你們王總？\n何京：是的。你說我要打領帶嗎？\n麗麗：嗯……還是打領帶吧！比較正式一些。\n何京：我的西服呢？\n麗麗：哎呀，我幫你拿去洗衣店洗，忘記取回來了。\n何京：現在洗衣店還開門嗎？\n麗麗：那麼晚了，應該關門了。\n何京：沒關係，那我明天去取。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Should I Wear a Tie?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你明天要去参加开业典礼，是吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你明天要去參加開業典禮，是嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ míng tiān yào qù cān jiā kāi yè diǎn lǐ shì ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: You're going to visit an opening ceremony tomorrow, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "何京：是的。",
      "traditional": "何京：是的。",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng shì de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: Yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：和你们王总？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：和你們王總？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hé nǐ men wáng zǒng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Together with Manager Wang?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "何京：是的。你说我要打领带吗？",
      "traditional": "何京：是的。你說我要打領帶嗎？",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng shì de nǐ shuō wǒ yào dǎ lǐng dài ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: Yes. What do you think, should I wear a tie?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：嗯……还是打领带吧！比较正式一些。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：嗯……還是打領帶吧！比較正式一些。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì èn hái shi dǎ lǐng dài ba bǐ jiào zhèng shì yì xiē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Hmm… Yes, wear a tie! It's a bit more formal."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "何京：我的西服呢？",
      "traditional": "何京：我的西服呢？",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng wǒ de xī fú ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: Where's my suit?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：哎呀，我帮你拿去洗衣店洗，忘记取回来了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：哎呀，我幫你拿去洗衣店洗，忘記取回來了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì āi yā wǒ bāng nǐ ná qù xǐ yī diàn xǐ wàng jì qǔ huí lái le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ah. I took it to the cleaner's to wash it for you, but forgot to pick it up."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "何京：现在洗衣店还开门吗？",
      "traditional": "何京：現在洗衣店還開門嗎？",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng xiàn zài xǐ yī diàn hái kāi mén ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: Is the cleaner's still open?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那么晚了，应该关门了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那麼晚了，應該關門了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà me wǎn le yīng gāi guān mén le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: This late? I'm sure they're closed."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "何京：没关系，那我明天去取。",
      "traditional": "何京：沒關係，那我明天去取。",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng méi guān xi nà wǒ míng tiān qù qǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: That's ok, I'll go pick it up tomorrow."
    }
  ],
